Changes:
- Changed pop.js to log moddedpops based on a schema
- Added afkTemplates for osanc in afkTemplates.json.
- Added osanc keypops in keypop.json.
- Added moddedSchema field for each keypop object.
- Added logging for osanc in logInfo.json
- Added new quota fields and values for osanc in quotas.json.
- Added new tracked stats into stats.json for osanc.
- Removed debug print statement in templates.js

Fixes:
- Fixed currentweek.js to handle the discord embed field limit when printing out quota values
- Temporary fix to handling variations of currentweek in log.js

These changes for osanc require the creation of the following columns in the schema, as a separate osanc db hasn't been created yet. I can take responsibility for migrating this information if this ever becomes the case.

